# PRD: AI JSON Explain Feature

## Feature Name

**Explain JSON (AI Summary)**

## Goal

Help users quickly understand large or unfamiliar JSON files without manually reading thousands of lines.

After uploading a JSON document, users can click an **"Explain"** button to receive a structured, human-readable explanation generated by an LLM running in **Thinking Mode**.

---

# Problem

Many users upload JSON that they did not create:

* API responses
* Logs
* Configuration files
* AI outputs
* Database exports
* Analytics payloads

Even with a good JSON viewer, understanding:

* what the JSON represents
* important fields
* relationships
* missing values
* anomalies

can take several minutes.

AI can reduce this to a few seconds.

---

# User Story

> As a developer,

I upload a JSON file.

Instead of manually exploring it,

I click **Explain**

and receive an intelligent summary describing the structure, purpose, and important insights inside the JSON.

---

# User Flow

```
Upload JSON

↓

JSON loads into editor

↓

Explain button becomes enabled

↓

User clicks Explain

↓

Thinking Mode request sent to AI

↓

Summary panel opens

↓

User can continue asking follow-up questions
```

---

# UI

Toolbar

```
Upload

Format

Validate

Diff

Explain ⭐
```

Clicking Explain opens right-side panel.

```
---------------------------------

AI Explanation

---------------------------------

Summary

This JSON represents an ecommerce order...

---------------------------------

Main Objects

• customer

• shipping

• products

• payment

---------------------------------

Interesting Findings

• Contains 4 products

• Total amount = $245

• One optional field missing

---------------------------------

Suggested Questions

• Explain customer object

• Show payment flow

• Find nullable fields

---------------------------------
```

---

# AI Prompt

The uploaded JSON should be sent with an instruction similar to:

> Explain this JSON as if helping a developer understand it for the first time.

Include:

* overall purpose
* main entities
* important fields
* nested structures
* relationships
* optional fields
* unusual values
* potential issues
* estimated source of JSON
* concise summary

Return markdown.

---

# Thinking Mode

This feature should always use:

* Thinking enabled
* Higher reasoning budget

Reason:

The model often needs to infer relationships across deeply nested objects and recognize common schemas (OpenAPI, Kubernetes, AWS, Stripe, etc.). A higher reasoning budget generally produces clearer and more accurate explanations.

---

# Response Format

```
## Summary

...

## What this JSON represents

...

## Main Objects

...

## Relationships

...

## Important Fields

...

## Interesting Observations

...

## Potential Issues

...

## Suggested Next Questions
```

---

# Technical Flow

```
Upload JSON

↓

Validate JSON

↓

Store parsed object

↓

Explain button

↓

Serialize JSON

↓

Send to AI endpoint

(thinking=true)

↓

Receive markdown

↓

Render markdown panel
```

---

# Future Enhancements

### Explain Selection

Highlight part of JSON

↓

Explain only selected object.

---

### Explain Path

Right-click

```
user.address

↓

Explain this object
```

---

### Multiple Detail Levels

* Beginner
* Developer
* Expert

---

### Architecture Diagram

Generate visual representation of JSON hierarchy.

---

### Mermaid Diagram

Generate Mermaid graph from JSON relationships.

---

### Interactive Chat

Allow follow-up questions such as:

* "What does this field do?"
* "Why is this nested?"
* "Which fields are required?"
* "Generate TypeScript interface"
* "Generate JSON Schema"
* "Find PII"
* "Find secrets"
* "Explain validation errors"

---

# Success Metrics

* Percentage of uploaded JSON files that users explain
* Average time spent reading explanations
* Follow-up AI interactions per explanation
* User satisfaction (thumbs up/down)
* Increased retention among AI feature users

---

# MVP Scope

**Included**

* Upload JSON
* "Explain" button
* AI-powered structured summary
* Thinking Mode enabled
* Markdown rendering
* Suggested follow-up questions

**Excluded (Future)**

* Explain selected node
* Interactive AI chat
* Mermaid diagrams
* JSON architecture visualization
* Multiple explanation styles
* Security/PII analysis
* Schema generation

This MVP delivers immediate value with a single-click explanation workflow while laying the foundation for more advanced AI-assisted JSON exploration features.

